{#- The About page, shared by the three languages. -#}
<section class="shell page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ "The philosophy behind the work" | t(lang) }}</p>
  <h1>{{ "Clarity into action." | t(lang) }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ "Stiven Catalyst is built around one idea: better results begin with clearer thinking, and clearer thinking matters only when it changes what happens next." | t(lang) }}</p>
</section>

<section class="shell about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-author-heading">
  <figure class="about-portrait"><img src="/media/stiven-headshot.jpg" alt="Stiven Janaqi" width="360" height="360"></figure>
  <div class="about-intro-copy">
    <p class="kicker">{{ "Behind the work" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <h2 id="about-author-heading">Stiven Janaqi</h2>
    <p class="about-role">{{ "Operations & leadership · Last mile · Hotels" | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "Stiven has led operations and teams for more than ten years: in retail and wholesale in Albania, then in last-mile logistics and hotels in Germany. As Area Manager for last-mile operations he led four shift leads and eight dispatchers, with about 250 drivers on the road. Today he coordinates last-mile operations and runs the night shift at an airport hotel in Frankfurt." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "He has seen how a missed handoff, an unclear standard or a rushed shift changes the number on a dashboard. He writes from that practical perspective and builds small tools that help people see the work, ask better questions and make the next shift easier to run." | t(lang) }}</p>
    {#- Each figure under its label; the figure is shown first. #}
    <dl class="about-stats">
      <div><dt>{{ "years in operations and leadership" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>10+</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "shift leads and dispatchers led" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>12</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "drivers on the road, led indirectly" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>~250</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{{ "damage rate as Area Manager" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>{{ "3% → 1%" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="about-links">
      {%- for profile in site.profiles %}
      <a class="text-link" href="{{ profile }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">{{ "LinkedIn" if "linkedin.com" in profile else profile }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
      <a class="text-link" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shell section about-path" aria-labelledby="about-path-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">{{ "Experience" | t(lang) }}</p>
      <h2 id="about-path-heading">{{ "Ten years close to the work." | t(lang) }}</h2>
    </div>
    <p>{{ "Retail and wholesale in Albania, then last-mile logistics and hotels in Germany: the places the essays and tools come from." | t(lang) }}</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="about-timeline">
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">{{ "2025 – today" | t(lang) }}</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Last-mile coordination and hotel night management" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Remote coordination of 80+ vehicles and 100+ drivers; night manager and front office at an airport hotel in Frankfurt." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2025</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Team Leader, then Area Manager, last-mile operations" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Promoted after five months. Damage rate from 3% to 1%, incomplete deliveries from 0.8% to 0.1%, delays at 2.5% against a 5% target." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2021 – 2024</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Parcel delivery, last-mile dispatch and hotel night audit" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Started again as a parcel courier, then dispatch for 70+ drivers a shift at a delivery station; night audit and front office at hotels in Frankfurt, for a time alongside parcel delivery." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2015 – 2021</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Retail and wholesale management in Albania" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "Store manager, department head, general sales manager and cluster manager. Teams of up to 16 people; a network of 61 resellers that grew revenue by 30–40%." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="about-when">2012 – 2015</span>
      <div><h3>{{ "Bachelor of Business Administration" | t(lang) }}</h3><p>{{ "University of Durrës, final grade 9.38 / 10, with a scholarship, alongside work in a telecom company's shops." | t(lang) }}</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <dl class="about-more">
    <div><dt>{{ "Languages" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>{{ "Albanian (native) · English C1 · Italian C1 · German B1" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
    <div><dt>{{ "Methods and systems" | t(lang) }}</dt><dd>{{ "Lean · 6S · Gemba walks · Pareto · 5 Whys · SAP · OPERA PMS · Power BI" | t(lang) }}</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

<section class="shell about-grid">
  <aside class="about-aside">
    <div class="brand-poster about-brand-poster" role="img" aria-label="{{ 'Stiven Catalyst visual identity' | t(lang) }}">
      <span class="brand-cable"></span>
      <span class="brand-bulb"></span>
      <div class="brand-wordmark">
        <small>STIVEN</small>
        <strong>CATALYST</strong>
        <em>{{ "Clarity · Insight · Action · Change" | t(lang) }}</em>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="about-copy">
    <h2>{{ "The light is clarity. The catalyst is movement." | t(lang) }}</h2>
    <p class="large-copy">{{ "Stiven Catalyst exists to turn observation into insight, insight into action and action into progress." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The light bulb at the heart of the identity represents the moment when a complex problem becomes clear. But clarity alone is not enough. The meaning of" | t(lang) }} <em>{{ "Catalyst" | t(lang) }}</em> {{ "is what follows: creating the conditions for an idea, a person, a team or a system to move forward." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The red and blue visual language reflects that tension. Blue stands for clarity, analysis and perspective. Red brings urgency, energy and change. Black gives the work discipline and seriousness; white creates space to think; gold is reserved for small moments of value and emphasis." | t(lang) }}</p>

    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Clarity" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Understand the problem before reacting to the symptom." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "People" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Results are created by people working inside real systems." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Systems" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "Good performance should be repeatable, not dependent on heroics." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
      <div class="pillar"><strong>{{ "Change" | t(lang) }}</strong><span>{{ "An idea becomes valuable when it changes behaviour or outcomes." | t(lang) }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <p class="large-copy">{{ "See clearly. Think differently. Act deliberately." | t(lang) }}</p>
    <p>{{ "The publication explores leadership, operations, hospitality, logistics, service, accountability, process design and the everyday realities of managing people. It is also an archive of tools and systems built to make work clearer and more reliable." | t(lang) }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/book-feature.njk" %}
